            "review_text": "candice t\nuk19 contributions\n0\nFabulous food and brilliant service.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe visited this restaurant after previously trying the sister restaurant near our hotel. We sat on the balcony and had an incredible view of the city. We ate spring rolls, shrimp pancakes, and pork stew. It was very tasty food and the service was wonderful. A two for one offer on cocktails was appreciated too! If you are in the city, you really must visit this beautiful place. Tim will make sure you feel welcome. Thank you .\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2026",
