            "review_text": "Fred B\nMarseille, France36 contributions\n0\nExcellent restaurant\nJun 2026 • Couples\nWe went there upon our arrival in Saigon for dinner, we did not want to miss this spot after discovering Timothée's journey on TV. \nA very well-decorated restaurant, an intimate atmosphere, and delicious dishes. \nTimothée was present and we were able to talk at length, he was very available for us. \nDon't miss this Saigonese experience. \nOur regret is that we could not return due to lack of time, too many things to do and to enjoy on site.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten June 29, 2026",
