            "review_text": "Irina999\n2 contributions\n0\nHome Cooked\nMay 2026 • Family\nWhile strolling along Saigon's main street, we discovered a small local restaurant.\nThe sign was visible on the main street, but the entrance was on the side. \nWe had to go up to the sixth floor to get there. We were looking for a place for lunch and didn't make a mistake.\n The food was delicious and home-cooked. The icing on the cake was the incredibly delicious dessert—a French crepe with caramel and ice cream—simply delicious. \nI highly recommend this restaurant; it's clean and atmospheric.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 27, 2026",
